Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.87,0:00:23.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.32,0:00:25.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Kay. Be there in a sec.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.24,0:00:30.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in an awfully good mood today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.37,0:00:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I am!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.71,0:00:34.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today's the day my dream comes true!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.09,0:00:38.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't help but notice\Nyou're working hard on your day off.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.56,0:00:39.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Try not to overdo—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.67,0:00:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be home by dinnertime.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.29,0:00:46.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.14,0:00:50.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, guess I'd better get ready—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,MAY!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.15,0:00:55.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's Hinata! He's...!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.67,0:02:05.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,37.8°C.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.81,0:02:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna die?! What should we do?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Hinata dies, I'll die, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.78,0:02:14.68,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're being dramatic. I told you it's just a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.64,0:02:22.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Cecil were here, I'd have her cast a healing spell,\Nbut she already left for work...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.19,0:02:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, you wait here! I'll go get her right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.58,0:02:27.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't bother her while she's working.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.83,0:02:32.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's low-grade fever. I'll just take\Nsome medicine and sleep it off.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you ought to at least eat something...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.41,0:02:39.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, why don't you make Hinata something\Nthat'll be light on his stomach?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.34,0:02:41.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Light on his stomach...?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.53,0:02:43.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A rice porridge would probably be easiest.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never made anything like that before!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should make it, May!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.10,0:02:52.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to, but I'm supposed to film\Na collab video in a little while.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A collab?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.30,0:02:54.11,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.11,0:02:59.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get the chance to do my dream collaboration\Nwith the magical girl idol trio
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.05,0:03:02.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who inspired me to start streaming in the first place!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you even care what happens to Hinata?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.35,0:03:05.33,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,I-I do, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.60,0:03:08.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, don't put her in a tough spot.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, May.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me and go have fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.57,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye! Hope you feel better!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.04,0:03:24.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it, Hinata? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.13,0:03:29.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there something you need me to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.56,0:03:34.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just... It makes me nervous\Nwhen you hover over me like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.03,0:03:37.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me. I can't help but worry about you...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're alright? Wanna suck on my boobs?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.45,0:03:45.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.81,0:03:50.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't know how to help you. I'm totally lost...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.45,0:03:53.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, I promise. It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.26,0:04:00.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, for now, why don't you make Hinata\Nsomething that'll be light on his stomach?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.09,0:04:02.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rice porridge...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Empty...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.79,0:04:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're having a sale today,\Nso I figured I'd wait and buy everything at once...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.35,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Should you be up right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.35,0:04:16.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll go shopping once I'm feeling a little better.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.14,0:04:19.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go lie back down.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.51,0:04:20.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.36,0:04:22.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get some groceries!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.41,0:04:29.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ugh, work was rough...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.39,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Her figure is incredible. She a model?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.59,0:04:30.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can't wait for the party today!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.39,0:04:33.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All these people's emotions... It's too much!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.45,0:04:34.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.83,0:04:37.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.12,0:04:39.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're alone? Where's Sunohara?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.34,0:04:40.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At home sick with a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What? Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.46,0:04:46.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided to go shopping so\Nthat I can make him rice porridge...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.12,0:04:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made a list and everything,\Nbut I don't know where to shop...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.46,0:04:51.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything on my own...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.79,0:04:54.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bell! It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.47,0:04:57.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you need to buy? I'll help you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what friends are for, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I can't breathe, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.89,0:05:08.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-How about you show me the list you made?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.81,0:05:10.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.94,0:05:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you leave me your address,\NI can deliver it to your front door.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.83,0:05:15.80,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.80,0:05:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course, it would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.92,0:05:24.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're the young lady who's always with Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He isn't with you today?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.12,0:05:31.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara's sick with a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too bad. Here...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take these with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.25,0:05:40.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In times of need, we oughtta help each other out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he asleep?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.05,0:05:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,His fever's still high... He's sweating, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, do you have a hot towel or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where am I...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're in Heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.01,0:06:03.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.74,0:06:05.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.01,0:06:06.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.53,0:06:12.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just sit still. We're going to make you feel all better...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.21,0:06:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sensitive here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.02,0:06:22.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No fair. I want a turn!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.09,0:06:25.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Stop it! I can't get up!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.43,0:06:29.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really...? But you got this part up just fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.65,0:06:31.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right. Impressive.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.60,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now I want a taste...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get to go first, right, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.05,0:06:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.76,0:06:44.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,NO, WAIT—!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.37,0:06:47.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.59,0:06:49.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, did we wake you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were sweating like crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.42,0:06:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Hi, Sunohara.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mochida? You're here, too? But why?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, stay still.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.29,0:07:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feels like your fever went down a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.55,0:07:04.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Think you can eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.44,0:07:08.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good. Then I'll go whip something up.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.22,0:07:09.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need to apologize.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.30,0:07:14.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, it makes me happy that I get to help you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.64,0:07:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd gladly do anything so long as it benefits you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.38,0:07:30.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gobbled that down quick, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.53,0:07:34.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The fact that you've got an appetite means you're on\Nthe mend.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.39,0:07:37.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, there's that, and... it was really tasty.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.79,0:07:42.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have done it without your help, Sakura!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.27,0:07:44.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind eating a meal like that every day!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.78,0:07:50.48,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Don't tell me that was a... p-p-proposal?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I just—!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.73,0:07:54.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, then I'll make it every day!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.66,0:07:57.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cut it out, Bell! Not in front of Mochida!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.91,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,This is perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, you're sweating.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.67,0:08:04.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. The rice porridge was warm, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.41,0:08:09.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll grab you a change of clothes,\Nso why don't you hop in the bath?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Alright, if you insist.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The water feels nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I'm not so achy anymore...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sunohara...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.08,0:08:26.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just sit still. We're going to make you feel all better...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, talk about a wild dream...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.39,0:08:31.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, come back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's bathe together!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.44,0:08:34.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't—!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, I'll scrub you down!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.65,0:08:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, Mochida!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.83,0:08:46.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out now! You two enjoy the bath!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.02,0:08:47.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.22,0:08:50.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I saw Sunohara naked...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.01,0:08:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This sucks. I wanted to take a bath with Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.38,0:08:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really do love Hinata, don't you, Bell?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.56,0:09:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course. Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.29,0:09:04.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata and I were destined for each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.29,0:09:10.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Suhonara's a lucky guy, having someone\Nlike you care so much about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.32,0:09:13.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah? I hope so.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.18,0:09:17.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That reminds me. Do you like anyone, Sakura?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? W-Well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.95,0:09:22.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Judging by that face, you do!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're they like?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.09,0:09:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's sweet, and he's warm like sunshine,\Nand he goes out of his way to help others... I guess?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh... He sounds a lot like Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.87,0:09:37.95,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you told him?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, I can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you don't tell him, nothing will come of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.58,0:09:45.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Instead of just waiting around,\Nyou've got to do something!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.79,0:09:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do something, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.68,0:09:53.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Lord Hinata caught a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.15,0:09:58.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell's never been very good at cooking.\NI bet they're starving!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.62,0:10:02.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.94,0:10:04.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How're you feeling, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel a whole lot better now.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.49,0:10:10.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And who's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon my manners!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.78,0:10:16.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura Mochida. I'm Sunohara's classmate.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, you're May, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Do I know you?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, I've watched\Nevery single one of your streams!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.93,0:10:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're a friend of Bell's, then that means you really are\Nfrom another world and it's not just a joke for the internet!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.71,0:10:33.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder I felt like all the parallel world\Nstuff was so realistic!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.55,0:10:37.40,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, are your ears real?!\NU-Um, if you don't mind, could I touch—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.40,0:10:39.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura, take a breath.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A fan of May's videos?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ask your questions one at a time, please. Slowly.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.91,0:10:47.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.94,0:10:52.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, so fluffy!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.85,0:10:54.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That kinda tickles!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.56,0:10:59.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Just be a little more gentle, 'kay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.52,0:11:01.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.23,0:11:03.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This might be the most fun I've ever had.
